flowchart TD

    %% ENTRY POINTS (Phases C/D)
    A[Member: Open My Schedule or the event detail page]
    B[Member: Select alternate upcoming event from picker - capacity visible]

    A --> B

    %% RESCHEDULE GUARDS (Phase C.7)
    C{Guards}
    D[403: schedule belongs to another member]
    E[404: target event missing or inactive]
    F[409: same event / already registered on target / target full]

    B --> C
    C -->|pass| G[Record DB: Update schedule - event_id and venue_id move to target event]
    C -->|fail| D
    C -->|fail| E
    C -->|fail| F

    %% ALTERNATIVE: CANCEL (Phase D)
    H[Member: Cancel registration instead]
    I[Record DB: Soft-delete schedule row - slot freed for others]

    A --> H --> I

    %% OUTPUT
    J[Site: My Schedule list and public capacity counts refresh]
    K[Member: Download updated iCal]

    G --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K

    L[No action taken]
    B -->|No| L
